  "scientific_limitations": [
    "The source 2016 AllData 62-P pollen subset includes only 47 of 94 visited and 15 of 65 open controls; no bagged control pollen. Unmeasured pollen not zero.",
    "Despite same exact ramet source ID, stigma pollen and mature seeds may be sampled from different marked flowers and aggregated at ramet level.",
    "2016 weeks 1-3 exclusively RG and 4-5 exclusively SP, so week and site are confounded; only two sites, week folds are not independent ecosystems.",
    "Source 2016 control O has no OBSERVED visit and is coded 0 recorded visits; cannot infer no real missed visit.",
    "2015 experiment includes week-four cut-flower intervention and plant-level aggregation; 2015 and 2016 remain one published biological programme.",
    "Only observed conspecific/heterospecific pollen grain number, not directly proven compatible paternal alleles or surviving recruitment.",
    "The original 2020 authors already showed per-visitor bumblebee efficiency and seasonally compensated seed production.",
    "A negative heldout pollen-increment result is not evidence that pollen quantity/effectiveness has no causal biological effect.",
    "No evidence for urban/island shared functional fragmentation regime or full eco-genetic genetic-mating trajectory."
